              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "andũ anene na aasa, ana ma Aanaki, ala ũmesĩ, na ala weewie maiwetwa atĩĩ, Nũũ ũla ũtonya kũũngama mbee wa ana ma Anakĩ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manya ĩndĩ ũmũnthĩ, kana Yeova Ngai waku nĩwe ũla wĩinga mbee waku o ta mwaki ũla ũminaa; nake akamananga, na kũmanyivya mbee waku: kwondũ wa ũu ũkamalũngya, na kũmananga mĩtũkĩ, o tondũ Yeova ũneenete naku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
