              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambata kĩĩmanĩ kwosa masengea ma mavia, o masengea ma ũtianĩo ũla Yeova watianĩe nenyu, nĩvo nekalile kĩĩmanĩ mĩthenya mĩongo ĩna na matukũ mĩongo ĩna; ndyaaya lĩu kana kũnyw’a manzĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
