            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa mĩthenya mĩongo ĩna na matukũ mĩongo ĩna yathela, Yeova anenga ala masengea elĩ ma mavia, namo nĩ masengea ma ũtianĩo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova ambĩa, Ũkĩla, ũtheee mĩtũkĩ; nĩkwĩthĩwa andũ maku ala wamaumisye nthĩ ya Misili nĩmevukĩtye; mĩtũkĩ nĩmathũkĩte nzĩanĩ ĩla nameaĩe; nĩmeseũvĩsye mũvw’anano na syĩndũ matwekethetye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
