              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ nakĩaa ũthatu na kũthilĩka, kũla Yeova wamũthilĩkĩle amwanange. Ĩndĩ Yeova ambĩthukĩĩsya ĩvinda yĩu nayo. ",
          "type": "text",
