          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na noosa naĩ yenyu, nayo nĩ kasaũ kala mwaseũvĩtye, nakavĩvya na mwaki, nakatumbanga, nakathia kavinya, katw’ĩka ta kĩtoo: na neekĩa kĩtoo kyako kalũsĩnĩ kala katheeete kuma kĩĩmanĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
