        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu navalũka mbee wa Yeova mĩthenya mĩongo ĩna na matukũ mĩongo ĩna ala navalũkile, nũndũ Yeova nĩwaĩtye akamwananga. ",
          "type": "text",
